k at this next  chart you can see that there are all  sorts of things that are feeding into  this energy food all sorts of goods  services everything is up  it's all up driving both the headline  and core inflation headline or cpi  inflation at 6.8 percent core inflation  if you take out things like food and  energy still at 4.9  so if you use all the normal goods and  services you have 6.8 inflation but if  you could pull off a miracle and not use  food or energy or shelter you still  would be experiencing almost 5  inflation  this is a serious serious problem it's  not a joke it's not a drill inflation is  a threat to 45 of americans purchasing  power because they hold no investable  assets they are being destroyed because  we have undisciplined policy  if we go ahead and we look at the  individual assets charlie bolello had a  great breakdown gasoline is up 58  mic drop this is absurd are you kidding  me  it's not only because of monetary and  fiscal policy we also are shutting down  pipelines we're releasing strategic  reserves we have all sorts of [ __ ]  going on in the gasoline market but it's  58  increase year over year you tell me a  society that can sustain a society that  is using gasoline and other types of  energy  prices go up 58 year over year this is  absurd used cars are up 31 gas utilities  up 25 good luck it's winter time get  ready to pay your heating bill  meat fish eggs 12 new cars up 11. if you  want transportation i don't care if you  buy a new or used car you're paying  double digits more  overall cpi's at 6.8 electricity you  just want to have electricity we've had  electricity for a century  but now you got to pay 6.5 more than you  were paying last year if you want to eat  literally your human body wants food  i don't care if you eat at home if you  eat away if you get fast food or you go  to a five-star restaurant you're paying  at least  5.8 more and if you eat at home you pay  6.4  more  apparel transportation and shelter all  up big 